  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Pacific Islands legal Information Institute (PacLII)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PacLII will support the provision of free access to legal information in the Pacific Islands and thereby help to ensure that the legal systems of all Pacific nations operate effectively and efficiently. The funding will support access to justice and enable the rule of law in the region- an important to Australia&#x2019;s interests in the Pacific.</narrative>
  </description>
